{
  "name": "Day 53 Solution: AI Workflow Scaling",
  "description": "Batches a large item array through Split In Batches with a throttling Wait step so AI calls stay under provider rate limits, then aggregates a final report.",
  "tags": ["week8", "ai-agents", "scaling"],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 53 Solution: AI Workflow Scaling\n\nAccepts a batch of 20+ items over a webhook, processes them 5 at a time via Split In Batches with a throttling Wait before each AI call, then reports totals once every batch is done.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key. None needed to test the batching/looping structure.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_53_AI_Workflow_Scaling.md for the full task.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "batch-throttle-math-sticky",
      "name": "Batch Size & Throttle Math",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 20],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Batch size / throttle math\n\nBatch size 5 + a 2s Wait per batch = 5 items every 2 seconds ≈ 150 items/minute max throughput. Most OpenAI tiers allow at least 500 requests/minute, so this stays well under the limit even before counting that each batch only fires one request burst, not 5 simultaneous ones. If your provider's RPM limit were lower (e.g. 60/min), you'd need to raise the Wait to roughly `(60 / RPM_limit) * batchSize` seconds per batch to stay under it — show this math with your own account's real limit.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "batch-webhook",
      "name": "Batch AI Process",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "batch-ai-process",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "init-batch-context",
      "name": "Init Batch Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [490, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "items",
              "value": "={{ $json.items || [] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "batch_start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "total_item_count",
              "value": "={{ ($json.items || []).length }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "split-in-batches",
      "name": "Split In Batches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [740, 380],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 5,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wait-throttle",
      "name": "Throttle Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [990, 520],
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "seconds"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-batch-processing",
      "name": "AI Batch Item Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1240, 520],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You process one batch item at a time as part of a larger batch job. Respond with a brief classification or summary of the given text."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Item text: ' + ($json.text || JSON.stringify($json)) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-report",
      "name": "Generate Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [990, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "total_items",
              "value": "={{ $('Init Batch Context').item.json.total_item_count }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "success_count",
              "value": "={{ $items().length }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "failure_count",
              "value": "={{ $('Init Batch Context').item.json.total_item_count - $items().length }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "total_processing_time_ms",
              "value": "={{ $now.diff($('Init Batch Context').item.json.batch_start_time, 'milliseconds') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Batch AI Process": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Init Batch Context", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Init Batch Context": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Split In Batches", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split In Batches": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Generate Report", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ],
        [
          { "node": "Throttle Wait", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Throttle Wait": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "AI Batch Item Processing", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Batch Item Processing": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Split In Batches", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
